You are tasked with implementing a stable sorting algorithm for a custom data structure called `StableSortableArray`. The `StableSortableArray` class has the following interface:

```cpp
class StableSortableArray {
public:
  // Constructor to initialize the array with given elements
  StableSortableArray(std::vector<int> elements);

  // Sorts the array using a stable sorting algorithm
  void stableSort();

